[
  {
    "beat_id": 1,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian sits down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你为什么每次都喝我喝过的咖啡？",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "顾深把筷子插进面碗里，没吃。\n苏念坐在对面，手里攥着一双没拆封的一次性筷子。面馆的排风扇嗡嗡转着，油烟从后厨飘过来，混着醋和辣椒的味道。\n\"你为什么每次都喝我喝"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian hand pauses mid-motion",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念拆筷子的手停了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "巧合。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"巧合。\"她说。\n\"三次都是巧合？\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "面馆里很吵。旁边桌的男人在打电话，声音大得像在吵架。后厨的铁锅\"咣\"地一声被掀起来，油星子溅在灶台上。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks down",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "苏念的筷子终于拆开了。她低头吃面，面汤的热气扑在脸上，模糊了对面那个人的表情。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "第一次，我以为你口渴。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"第一次，我以为你口渴。\"顾深说。他的语速比平时更慢，像在拆一个包裹——每拆一层，都在确认里面有没有碎。\"第二次，我以为你习惯。第三次——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian looks up",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "他没说完。\n苏念抬头。顾深正看着她，灰色的眼睛在面馆的黄灯下变成深棕色。他的左手放在桌下，膝盖上——苏念看不到，但她知道那只手在发抖。\n因为他喝咖啡时，右手从来"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen drains the cup in one gulp",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你喝完之后，",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你喝完之后，\"顾深说，\"脸上的表情会变。像是——\"他停顿了两秒，找到一个词，\"——听到了什么。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian wipes the bowl",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Shock",
    "source_text": "排风扇突然卡了一下，发出一声尖锐的金属摩擦。苏念的筷子夹断了一根面条，掉回碗里，溅起一滴汤。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian wipes the apron",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她的围裙口袋里有一张纸巾。她掏出来擦手，纸巾被攥成了一团。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian speaks softly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你多想了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"你多想了。\"苏念说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen gazes at the bowl",
    "spoken_dialogue": "也许。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"也许。\"顾深把面碗推到一边。碗底在桌面上划出一道湿痕。\"但我从来不'多想'。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen stands up from the seat",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我送你回去。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他站起来，把钱压在碗下面。\n\"我送你回去。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 14,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian walks slowly the key",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "key",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "巷子里没有路灯。月光从两栋楼之间的缝隙漏下来，把青石板照成灰色。苏念走在前面，顾深走在后面，两个人的脚步声在窄巷里撞来撞去。\n苏念的钥匙在口袋里。她摸了三次才摸"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 15,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "苏念。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"苏念。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 16,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen turns around",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她转身。顾深站在两米外，月光把他的影子拉得很长，一直延伸到她的脚边。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 17,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen speaks softly the coffee cup",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我明天还会来喝咖啡。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我明天还会来喝咖啡。\"他说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 18,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian clenches fists tightly",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你不用——",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "key",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念的手攥紧了钥匙。齿痕陷进掌心。\n\"你不用——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 19,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "Gu Shen puts away",
    "spoken_dialogue": "我不是来收购你的店的。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "\"我不是来收购你的店的。\"顾深的声音在巷子里回荡了一下，被墙壁吸收了。\"我只是——\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 20,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at",
    "spoken_dialogue": "你让我想起一个人。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "他停了。\n苏念看着他。月光下，他的表情像是在做一个很难的数学题——每一步都精确，但答案怎么都凑不齐。\n\"你让我想起一个人。\"他终于说。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 21,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "但又完全不同。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Tension",
    "source_text": "苏念的心跳了一下。\n\"但又完全不同。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 22,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian brews coffee, steam rising",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "cup wall",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "他转身走了。脚步声在巷子里渐渐变远，最后消失在拐角。\n苏念靠在门框上。钥匙还攥在手里，掌心被齿痕硌得发红。\n她推开门，走进空荡荡的咖啡店。吧台上有一杯下午泡的红"
  },
  {
